  "title": "Charming Fully Furnished 3 Bed + 3 Bath Kitsilano House | Oct 1st - apartments / housing for rent - craigslist",
  "bodyText": "CL\n\nvancouver, BC >\n\nvancouver >\n\nhousing >\n\napartments / housing for rent\n\npost\naccount\nreply \nfavorite\n \nhide\n \n⚐\nflag\n \n\nshare\n\nPosted 11 days ago\n\nprint\n$10,500 / 3br - 1700ft2 - Charming Fully Furnished 3 Bed + 3 Bath Kitsilano House | Oct 1st (Kitsilano)\n3095 W 5th Ave, Vancouver, BC V6K1T8\n© craigslist - Map data © OpenStreetMap\n3095 W 5th Ave near Balaclava St\n\ngoogle map\n\n3BR / 3Ba 1700ft2 available oct 1\nrent period: monthly\nhouse\nw/d in unit\nfurnished\nstreet parking\nno smoking\nair conditioning\nProperty Details:\n\nProperty ID: 5877\nLocation: 3095 W 5th Avenue, Vancouver\nRent: $10,500/mo\nAvailability: October 1st\nFurnished: Yes\nBedroom: 3 Bedroom\nBathroom: 3 Bathroom\nSize of Area: 1,700 sqft\nPet: No\nParking: Street Parking\nUtilities: Not Included\nLease Term: Minimum lease term 4 months required\n\nDescription:\nSituated on a sun-drenched, south-facing corner lot in the heart of Kitsilano, this beautiful 1,700-square-foot Craftsman-style character home seamlessly blends 1920s architecture with contemporary luxury and picturesque North Shore mountain views. Bathed in natural light through generous windows, the open-concept 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom interior features rich wood flooring, refined architectural millwork, and a chef’s kitchen equipped with top-tier Wolf gas appliances, a Sub-Zero refrigerator, and premium custom finishes ideal for entertaining. Outdoors, the home transitions to a private yard and patio space that captures maximum southern exposure. Beyond the front door, you are surrounded by the best of Vancouver’s Westside: steps from the newly rebuilt General Gordon Elementary, minutes from Kitsilano Secondary, and directly connected to the scenic Kitsilano Bike Path for effortless cycling to UBC or Downtown. The vibrant West 4th Avenue corridor is just around the corner, offering boutique shopping, organic grocers, local cafes, and celebrated neighborhood dining, while the iconic sands and saltwater pool of Kitsilano Beach are only a short stroll away.\n\n\n\nPlease to this ad to arrange your private viewing or inquire about the house.\nPlease include your personal contact information for us to be able to assist you with your inquiry more promptly.\n\n\n\n** Professionally managed and marketed by Vancouver Luxury Realty. VLR does not charge prospective tenants any handling fees, application fees or processing fees. We are fully licensed with the Real Estate Council of British Columbia and simply act as the landlord/marketer for the owner. **\n\n**Any storage locker and parking stall measurement/size to be verified by prospective tenants if applicable.**\n\nMore info visit us @ www.vancouverluxuryrentals.com\n\n\npost id: 7966577196\n\n \n\nposted: 11 days ago\n\n \n\nupdated: a day ago\n\n \n\n♥ best of [?]\n\nhelp\nsafety\nprivacy\nterms\nabout\napp\n© 2026 craigslist",
